  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Use triangle law of vector addition,&nbsp;<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bce097f1-d91d-4d8d-99aa-44d92ad8b5b3-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 188px;\" /><br />here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, since net force is zero it means the body is in equilibrium so both the statements are correct.",
